    "body": "## Summary\n- add one bounded, weighted fixed-window budget per authenticated account across private mutations and 41 audited costly operations\n- preserve the dedicated routing-provider budget while extracting the duplicated HTTP limiter core\n- enforce controller-scan contracts for future private mutations and weighted rule drift\n- wire production configuration/Compose coverage and document the deployment boundary\n- advance roadmap item #623 while preserving the exact 965-item invariant\n\n## Security properties\n- provider/financial operations cost 20 units, storage/settlement transitions 10, amplified reads 5, and every other private mutation 1\n- anonymous routes remain owned by their dedicated IP limiters\n- unauthenticated requests continue to normal 401/403 handling\n- account state is bounded and fails closed for new keys at capacity\n- the current implementation is explicitly per-instance; #624/#625/#942 remain open for shared multi-node enforcement\n\n## Verification\n- `git diff --check`\n- GitHub Actions supply-chain pin contract (28 references)\n- production Compose contract syntax and new configuration assertions\n- roadmap invariant: `965 = 622 + 2 + 76 + 265`\n- full Maven, container and runtime suites delegated to this PR's exact-head GitHub Actions gate",
